      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "that is highly based on the avatar that you are using. the world is scaled to your arm length, that way they match your real arms. the problem with this is that if the legs of your model is longer than real life proportions, than there isn't much that can be done. if you use an avatar like xbot that has realistic proportions, the real floor matches... but most cartoon and anime models have really long legs that don't match.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
