      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I Believe what she's getting at is that we need an ingame adjustment so that we dont have to worry about arm length vs leg length and so on. Sure you can fix it by changing the hieght ofthe arms/legs butthen it breakes the fun of creativity. And NO Adjusting you height settings does not \"FIX\" the problem.",
