  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-11-20T09:33:40.343Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Your real floor to the vr floor varies for some reason and sometimes cant be changed no matter how you try to adjust your avatar. You know your headset is calibrated correctly, yet vrchat says \"the real floor is at your avatars knees\" and therefore leaning down to pickup a prop is impossible to reach. If we could have a vrchat floor calibration button in the menu we could refresh it from time to time depending on the avatar.",
